===Head to the Roots of the Arbor and repair its seal{{subst:void|<!--202060202-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Scalegorge Waterscape|update|It is the duty of the Luofu Vidyadhara to repair the Ambrosial Arbor's seal. The high elder of the Luofu Vidyadhara and the one who possesses the power of the previous high elder must shoulder this duty together before the roots of the arbor.<br />Dan Heng said he wishes to return his power to the Luofu high elder, but such powers cannot simply be borrowed or returned on a whim.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Bailu:''' ...Wowwww, what a magnificent sight! Is that the Ambrosial Arbor?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Yes. Forming a seal and using their power to curb the spread of the Arbor's roots is an important task entrusted to the Luofu's high elder.
:'''Bailu:''' News to me. The elders must be well aware that I'm not qualified for this position.
:'''Bailu:''' Which begs the question... why did Dan Feng choose me all those years ago?
:'''Dan Heng:''' That's exactly what I've come to Scalegorge Waterscape to find out.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Among the Vidyadhara, the high elder is the existence closest to the Permanence.
:'''Dan Heng:''' According to historical records, the high elder succession involves a secret ritual known as the Transmutation Arcanum, as well as a treasure known as dragon heart. Once succession is complete, the former high elder undergoes a hatching rebirth, while the new high elder begins to display draconic features.
:'''Dan Heng:''' However, Dan Feng's ritual failed, and his powers remained within me... And yet for some reason, it also created you.
:'''Bailu:''' So in medical terms &mdash; he messed up the prescription... and brought suffering down on himself and just about everyone else in the process.
:'''Dan Heng:''' I want to use this opportunity to repair the Ambrosial Arbor's seal and see if I can help recall our memories...
