===Leave the Scalegorge Waterscape using Mirage Echolocation{{subst:void|<!--202060212-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Scalegorge Waterscape|update|The Vidyadhara assassins used cloudhymn magic to conceal themselves and get close to you before attacking. As a seasoned warrior, Dan Heng is more than capable of handling himself, but Bailu is another deal, and will need your protection!<br />The Vidyadhara Mirage Echo offers active responses to both Dan Heng and Bailu. Listen to what they're saying and maybe it will help you all understand what happened all those years ago.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Bailu:''' Look &mdash; look at that shadow... Could it be an assassin?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Don't worry &mdash; those things aren't hostile.

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Old Voice:''' This power... it rivals the tidal forces in Scalegorge Waterscape. Is that you, Dan Feng... Have you returned?
:'''Dan Heng:''' I'm afraid you have the wrong person.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is this?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this... a Vidyadhara ghost?
:'''Dan Heng:''' These floating shadows are called Mirage Echoes. They are memories of past lives and echoes from the past that the Vidyadhara shed during their rebirth.
:'''Bailu:''' The books say that these mirages only speak to people they can recognize, and the water on their bodies can be used as medicine!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Seems this mirage mistook me for Dan Feng.
:'''Old Voice:''' There's no mistake... This old man would recognize your voice anywhere. Hehe... Have you come to this sacred place to repent?
:'''Old Voice:''' The proud son of the Vidyadhara, hero of the High-Cloud Quintet, hehe... You fought with us your whole life &mdash; how far you have fallen...
:'''Old Voice:''' You availed yourself of the Transmutation Arcanum to summon that draconic abomination... and almost laid waste to Scalegorge Waterscape in the process!
:'''Old Voice:''' If your allies hadn't united to slay it, then the abomination would have destroyed the Ambrosial Arbor's seal. Tell me, did it sadden you to watch the abomination perish?
:'''Old Voice:''' As the high elder, you should have freed us from the plight of rebirth and set foot on a brand-new path... but instead you were seduced by your reputation and abandoned yourself... You counted Xianzhou natives and even short-life species among your friends...
:'''Old Voice:''' The upcoming trial is your final chance. Hand over the secrets of the Transmutation Arcanum now, and the Preceptors can help you keep your secret.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Transmutation Arcanum?
::'''Old Voice:''' Isn't that draconic abomination you created proof of the Transmutation Arcanum's success?
::'''Dan Heng:''' Hmm... I heard that Dan Feng craved the powers of our dragon ancestor, Long the Permanence, and created a monstrous dragon-like creature. That must be what he's referring to.
::'''Dan Heng:''' And so the hero of the Xianzhou became its arch-villain.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Trial?
::'''Old Voice:''' Our laws could have seen you executed &mdash; pity that the high elder succession could not be allowed to die with you.
::'''Old Voice:''' Caelorum Venti of the Yaoqing put forward a strong case for you, and the Ten-Lords Commission spared you from capital punishment. But the punishment of molting rebirth could not be avoided.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Elder, look around you. You've long since reincarnated. What remains here are just the mirages of the waters of the ancient sea.
:'''Old Voice:''' Impossible, I&mdash;I still live! The high elder succession will not be severed in this generation...
:'''Bailu:''' ...I don't like this Mirage Echo.
:'''Bailu:''' He thought that the Vidyadhara was superior to other races and that he was superior to other Vidyadhara... As if the Vidyadhara would never progress without their plans.
:<!--0.3-second delay-->
:<!--1-second delay-->
:'''Bailu:''' I guess Dan Feng probably never told them the secret of the Transmutation Arcanum...
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Dan Heng:''' We shouldn't linger here.
:'''Dan Heng:''' The assassins are using skilled cloudhymn magic to make themselves invisible... but their presence is all too real.
:'''Dan Heng:''' These Mirage Echoes, on the other hand, are vestiges of the past. {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|If we can center and transmit the echoes, we should be able to detect any assassins hidden beneath the surface of the water.}}
:'''Dan Heng:''' Let's look for Mirage Echoes and send out pulses. Move carefully.
----
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.DestroyNPC",
	"GroupID": 2,
	"GroupNpcID": 400001,
	"DestroyList": []
}</pre>
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' Miss Bailu, you fled the Alchemy Commission yet again! How many times have I told you, our rules state that&mdash;
:'''Bailu:''' Sorry, I'm sorry! I won't do it again!
:'''Bailu:''' ...Wait, I remember that voice. That's the old chief alchemist. So she's... been reborn?
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' Reborn? More excuses. Who brought you out this time. Is that... Master Dan Feng?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You've got the wrong person.
::'''Kind Female Voice:''' I don't think so. The appearance of the Luofu's High Elders have been similar through the ages, but there's no mistaking Master Dan Feng...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He's not Dan Feng.
::'''Kind Female Voice:''' Why do you remain silent? Your Highness, you're still as cold and lonely as you ever were, like the eternal ice on the Fanghu.
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' Bailu, return to the Forbidden Residence. I must speak with Master Dan Feng.
:'''Bailu:''' O&mdash;Okay.
:'''Bailu:''' ...W&mdash;Wait, no! You're just a Mirage Echo. Ugh, I got tricked again!
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' Master Dan Feng, I finally understand your plan. That little girl is the key to the Transmutation Arcanum! This is a breakthrough for my research!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...Your research?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...The key?
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' The Vidyadhara perform self-reincarnation, but we are unable to reproduce. Natural and artificial disasters inevitably reduce our population.
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' If this continues, one day our noble draconic bloodline will perish, and the fated decree of The Permanence will be violated. For this very reason, I have spent my entire life researching ways to free the Vidyadhara from the cycle of reincarnation.
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' I have been without success for a long, long time, thinking that this reincarnation had been nought but a waste. But now you have enlightened me!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Dan Feng... What did he do?
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' Master Dan Feng, your changes to the Transmutation Arcanum created a draconic abomination that wreaked great destruction... but it also created a new life! This is the hope that will one day allow the Vidyadhara to reproduce!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Allow the Vidyadhara to reproduce once again?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Created a new life?
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' My understanding of reproduction was limited by ordinary notions &mdash; how constrained I was! Why should Vidyadhara reproduction remain trapped within the confines of our race...
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' To unearth the potential might of Long's blood... and incorporate other races into the flesh of the dragon &mdash; isn't that the real meaning behind the Transmutation Arcanum?
:'''Kind Female Voice:''' The Preceptors are too narrow-minded to see your talent. They want to install another High Elder. Foolish!
:<!--0.3-second delay-->
:'''Bailu:''' ...What does she mean by that?
:'''Dan Heng:''' The Transmutation Arcanum seems to contain a secret that allows the Vidyadhara to escape the cycle of reincarnation and return to normal reproduction... but the mechanism eludes me.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Let's go.
----
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.DestroyNPC",
	"GroupID": 2,
	"GroupNpcID": 400002,
	"DestroyList": []
}</pre>
:<!--1-second delay-->
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Angry Voice:''' It's you, Master Dan Feng! Why did you disgrace yourself!
:'''Angry Voice:''' You were my hero &mdash; I dreamed of being just like you &mdash; of joining the Cloud Knights... But you betrayed the hopes and dreams of the elders!
:'''Dan Heng:''' This Mirage Echo... he must be a Cloud Knight who fought alongside Dan Feng all those years ago.
:'''Angry Voice:''' How many of us perished in that disaster and could not be reincarnated? And I... My leg was torn off by that abomination... Oh, the pain...
:'''Angry Voice:''' The doctors at the Alchemy Commission said I have to reincarnate as soon as possible to avoid affecting my immortal life... But my poor comrades have no chance of returning to the ancient sea.
:'''Angry Voice:''' You once told us that we should cherish every life cycle, and that you would use cloudhymn magic to heal our wounds... But in the end, all you did was betray us!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Dan Heng, you don't have to listen to him.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go...
:'''Dan Heng:''' I must listen to him very carefully &mdash; we cannot afford to miss any information.
:'''Angry Voice:''' I will never forgive you. The High Elder's power belongs to the Vidyadhara of the Luofu &mdash; you are unworthy. The Vidyadhara must not sever the High Elder succession tradition just because of you.
:'''Angry Voice:''' Hand it over!
:'''Bailu:''' Dan Heng, is this the price we pay for bearing the power of the High Elder? Carrying the weight of all these expectations, all this hatred...
:'''Dan Heng:''' Before any of this transpires, you have enough time to prepare.
----
