===Meet with Huanxi and leave the Scalegorge Waterscape{{subst:void|<!--202060215-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Scalegorge Waterscape|update|Your about to arrive at the Dragonvista Rain Hall next. If all goes as expected, those hidden assassins probably won't be able to attack as they please. Of course, the expected might still be followed by the unexpected.<br />Still, even if something happens, it's not a big deal. Dan Heng's always reliable. You can always count on Dan Heng.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Huanxi:''' Miss Bailu? Are you okay? You were in there for such a long time...
:'''Bailu:''' Luckily, I had Dan Heng and (Trailblazer) to protect me all the way. If anyone's owed a thanks, it's them.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This has been a very dangerous journey...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's a good thing we managed to escape.
:'''Huanxi:''' I didn't expect those assassins to be so brazen and reckless, storming a sacred place like Scalegorge Waterscape and pursuing you... Rest assured, Miss Bailu. I'll report them to the elders and round them all up.
:{{tx}}
