:'''Bailu:''' I always felt useless in the eyes of the elders &mdash; a false dragon who failed to inherit the power of the High Elder...
:'''Bailu:''' ...and today I realized &mdash; they'll use any means of removing me.
:<!--0.5-second delay-->
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Not all of the Vidyadhara harbor evil intentions. If you feel uneasy, Dragon Lady, the Seat of Divine Foresight can arrange for you to stay elsewhere.
:'''Bailu:''' Thank you, general. I'd like to talk more with Dan Heng first.
